    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Anne Frank’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "life",
            "ref": "v-life"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " was short. She was only fifteen years old when she "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "died",
            "ref": "v-die"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in 1945."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Anne was "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "born",
            "ref": "v-born"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Germany. Her father’s family had lived there for a very long time. In 1933, a man named "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Adolf Hitler",
            "zh": "阿道夫·希特勒"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "came into power",
            "zh": "上台执政"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Hitler "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "hated",
            "ref": "v-hate"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Jewish people",
            "zh": "犹太人"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The Franks were Jewish. So, they had to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "flee",
            "zh": "逃离"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Germany. They had to go into hiding."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "By the time Hitler was "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "defeated",
            "ref": "v-defeat"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", Anne’s mother was "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "dead",
            "ref": "v-dead"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". So were Anne and her sister. Anne’s father was the only one in the family who "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "survived",
            "ref": "v-survive"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But something else survived, too. Anne’s diary. Anne "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "kept a diary",
            "ref": "v-keep-a-diary"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for two years "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "while",
            "zh": "在……期间"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " her family was in hiding. Life was terrible then, but Anne was hopeful about the world in her diary."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Today, we are still reading Anne’s diary. A short life—even a very short life—can be full of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "meaning",
            "ref": "v-meaning"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
